WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:10.010
[theme music]

00:25.859 --> 00:27.527
Do they kill Choi Mujin?

00:31.740 --> 00:32.741
No.

00:33.658 --> 00:34.993
He wasn't at the gym.

00:35.952 --> 00:38.955
[camera shutter clicking]

00:39.539 --> 00:41.791
[Ms. Kang] No. We're doing fine.

00:42.959 --> 00:44.210
Thank you for checking.

00:58.058 --> 00:59.100
[Mujin] Ms. Kang.

00:59.184 --> 01:00.351
[Ms. Kang] Hmm.

01:00.435 --> 01:02.103
[Mujin] Should we prepare ourselves?

01:02.187 --> 01:03.605
[Ms. Kang] No, we should be fine.

01:04.189 --> 01:06.691
There's no official connection to the gym.

01:06.775 --> 01:07.776
Exactly.

01:10.028 --> 01:11.362
Don't give the cops anything.

01:11.446 --> 01:13.073
Make sure no one talks.

01:13.156 --> 01:14.199
[Ms. Kang] Yes, sir.

01:15.742 --> 01:19.037
[retreating footsteps]

01:19.621 --> 01:20.663
Did you check the cameras?

01:20.747 --> 01:21.915
They don't work.

01:22.540 --> 01:24.584
Bullshit. Look how many they've got.

01:25.794 --> 01:28.463
Of course, they don't work.
Gangs don't trust the police.

01:29.047 --> 01:30.048
[sighs]

01:31.925 --> 01:34.511
[indistinct chatter]

01:34.594 --> 01:35.720
[camera shutter clicks]

01:40.350 --> 01:42.352
[indistinct chatter continues]

01:46.731 --> 01:50.068
[tense music]

01:55.657 --> 01:59.077
- [Gunpyeong] Is this the only camera here?
- [woman] It's the only one we have.

02:06.417 --> 02:08.586
[indistinct chatter]

02:10.255 --> 02:12.799
[Daesoo] Is this delivery truck
assigned to this area?

02:13.967 --> 02:15.385
Sir, if you hear anything,

02:15.468 --> 02:17.887
- would you mind giving me a call, please?
- [drycleaner] I will.

02:22.851 --> 02:25.103
[siren wailing]

02:33.903 --> 02:35.029
[sighs]

02:35.780 --> 02:37.157
Let's try over there.

02:41.244 --> 02:43.329
[Pildo] None of the victims will talk.

02:44.789 --> 02:46.166
Who came back?

02:48.209 --> 02:49.335
Were you scared?

02:51.588 --> 02:52.839
Your first time?

02:55.049 --> 02:56.551
For me, it's been a while.

02:57.760 --> 03:00.096
Never seen anyone this ballsy before.

03:01.681 --> 03:03.766
DO NOT ENTER
UNDER INVESTIGATION

03:04.684 --> 03:06.144
We're cops.

03:06.227 --> 03:07.395
Don't be scared.

03:08.563 --> 03:09.772
I'm not scared.

03:11.024 --> 03:12.108
I'm sure you're not.

03:13.860 --> 03:15.528
[cell phone vibrates]

03:16.529 --> 03:17.530
Yeah?

03:20.658 --> 03:21.868
Yes, sir. Got it.

03:22.994 --> 03:24.787
Keep asking around. I gotta go.

03:30.168 --> 03:31.544
[engine starts]

03:34.505 --> 03:36.758
[engine revving]

03:40.386 --> 03:44.224
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT, SIR?

03:52.982 --> 03:55.193
[monk chanting]

04:42.782 --> 04:44.909
[tense music]

04:53.376 --> 04:55.461
[engine revving]

04:58.339 --> 04:59.299
[Cha Giho] Pildo.

05:00.133 --> 05:01.009
Move.

05:11.477 --> 05:12.645
We're in mourning.

05:13.229 --> 05:14.814
[Pildo] Mm-hm. We know.

05:15.940 --> 05:17.608
We're paying respects, punk.

05:20.737 --> 05:21.946
Move out of my way.

05:24.615 --> 05:25.867
[sighs]

05:37.628 --> 05:38.880
One person.

05:42.383 --> 05:43.801
That's fine.
[clicks tongue]

05:43.885 --> 05:45.928
We didn't bring an offering
for you, anyway.

05:46.012 --> 05:46.888
[chuckles]

05:50.558 --> 05:52.310
That must hurt, huh?

05:53.478 --> 05:55.521
[pensive music]

06:11.704 --> 06:14.665
[approaching footsteps]

06:19.087 --> 06:20.254
I'd love a drink.

06:35.061 --> 06:36.312
[exhales deeply]

06:49.367 --> 06:50.368
[scoffs]

06:55.498 --> 06:57.250
Destiny of a dog…

06:58.668 --> 07:00.002
follows its owners.

07:02.004 --> 07:05.842
That dog can live in luxury
if it gets lucky with a rich owner,

07:06.676 --> 07:09.595
or it ends up dying out on the street.

07:10.847 --> 07:11.931
It's a dog's death.

07:14.892 --> 07:16.602
You cops are incredible, you know that?

07:18.354 --> 07:22.108
Even incompetent idiots like you
can manage become captain.

07:24.652 --> 07:27.488
You know you'd already be dead
if you were in our world.

07:27.572 --> 07:28.531
[scoffs]

07:29.115 --> 07:30.158
[chuckles]

07:32.493 --> 07:33.494
[sighs]

07:35.580 --> 07:36.873
I'm sick of it, too.

07:38.583 --> 07:39.959
Let's end it, okay?

07:44.672 --> 07:46.591
How soon are you planning
on getting taken down?

07:50.803 --> 07:52.597
And why would I think of that?

08:01.272 --> 08:02.648
One thing I know.

08:07.862 --> 08:10.406
I'll never get caught
no matter what you do.

08:17.580 --> 08:18.789
[Pildo] Hey.

08:19.874 --> 08:21.709
What are you all doing here, huh?

08:22.627 --> 08:23.794
Here.

08:24.545 --> 08:26.714
Let me know if you ever wanna talk, huh?

08:28.257 --> 08:29.467
You wanna talk?

08:30.051 --> 08:31.511
Lots to say.

08:40.978 --> 08:41.896
[scoffs]

08:41.979 --> 08:44.857
[approaching footsteps]

08:49.445 --> 08:51.531
[Pildo] Think long and hard, okay?

08:52.114 --> 08:54.033
Your man can't catch those guys.

08:56.327 --> 08:57.954
Detective, let's go.

08:59.163 --> 09:00.122
See you.

09:09.465 --> 09:11.342
[Cheolho]
Where is that stupid cunt hiding?

09:12.260 --> 09:13.719
- Bored already.
- [laughs]

09:13.803 --> 09:16.556
I'll let you have a taste when I get her.
[chuckles]

09:17.181 --> 09:18.766
What the hell? Are you drunk?

09:19.308 --> 09:21.686
Ah! Sorry, man, I forgot.

09:21.769 --> 09:23.563
You can't fuck her anyway!

09:24.188 --> 09:25.648
You motherfucker!

09:26.899 --> 09:30.611
So let's catch her
and then we'll kill her.

09:33.739 --> 09:35.866
Why aren't we getting any buyers?

09:35.950 --> 09:37.660
We gave out plenty of stock!

09:39.370 --> 09:41.289
[scoffs]
Should I call Mango?

09:43.165 --> 09:45.459
You think Mango is getting funny ideas?

09:45.543 --> 09:48.296
[audience clamoring]

09:48.879 --> 09:50.131
Yes!

09:50.214 --> 09:52.758
[fighter grunting]

09:54.468 --> 09:58.264
[audience cheering]

09:58.347 --> 10:00.725
DONGCHEON’S CHOI MUJIN
STING OPERATION

10:00.808 --> 10:03.019
BALLISTICS FORENSICS ANALYSIS REQUEST

10:04.854 --> 10:06.314
- [door lock beeps]
- [door opens]

10:07.648 --> 10:08.816
[Pildo] Good work, sir.

10:09.734 --> 10:10.818
Find anything?

10:11.777 --> 10:12.612
Nothing.

10:12.695 --> 10:13.821
[Daesoo] Sergeant Jeon!

10:14.363 --> 10:15.364
Hello.

10:16.365 --> 10:18.409
Shit. Search this.

10:19.243 --> 10:20.328
Any new leads?

10:20.828 --> 10:24.290
No witness, no video,
it's hard to identify anyone.

10:24.373 --> 10:27.335
Pildo. Who am I?
[chuckles]

10:27.418 --> 10:28.544
[sighs]
Yeah.

10:28.628 --> 10:30.004
[clicking]

10:32.173 --> 10:34.008
[Daesoo] This is the kind of guy I am!

10:34.091 --> 10:35.259
[Daesoo laughs]

10:37.386 --> 10:38.888
Delivery truck's dashcam.

10:39.472 --> 10:41.599
I track down the driver in Seongan.

10:42.516 --> 10:43.517
Who is this?

10:43.601 --> 10:45.311
Looks familiar. We gotta look him up.

10:47.104 --> 10:48.356
[Gangjae] Why are you here?

10:48.439 --> 10:49.649
You're a girl.

10:49.732 --> 10:51.108
[screams]

10:58.115 --> 11:00.034
Don't you think he looked
kind of familiar though?

11:01.744 --> 11:04.580
[Cha Giho] Do Gangjae,
this asshole was in Dongcheon.

11:04.664 --> 11:06.874
[Pildo] He disappeared four years ago.

11:06.957 --> 11:08.834
And, now, it looks like he's back.

11:09.752 --> 11:11.087
Did something happen?

11:11.754 --> 11:14.048
There is a rumor
that someone died in the gym.

11:17.051 --> 11:18.636
But what Choi Mujin do?

11:19.387 --> 11:22.264
He knows we're onto him,
so I'm guessing he'll lay low, right?

11:25.101 --> 11:26.435
He won't do that.

11:28.020 --> 11:31.273
Choi Mujin's… ego was damaged.

11:35.736 --> 11:37.238
Go find Gangjae.

11:37.988 --> 11:40.116
It's dangerous to make a move now.

11:43.953 --> 11:45.121
Are you scared?

11:46.664 --> 11:47.915
No, sir.

11:51.001 --> 11:53.838
If we don't fight back,
the organization crumbles.

11:55.965 --> 11:58.884
I have to show them what kind
of operation they're dealing with.

12:00.469 --> 12:01.762
Meet Dongcheon.

12:03.639 --> 12:04.682
[sucks teeth]

12:09.145 --> 12:11.063
[clicks tongue]
First…

12:13.190 --> 12:14.191
let Mango go.

12:14.275 --> 12:15.276
- What?
- What?

12:15.943 --> 12:17.695
Let's see what Choi Mujin does.

12:18.821 --> 12:19.947
And Gangjae?

12:20.030 --> 12:21.490
Do we make an alert?

12:21.574 --> 12:23.033
You'll just let him be?

12:23.117 --> 12:25.578
No. Just observe it for the time being.

12:25.661 --> 12:28.122
[inhales sharply]
We'll get Choi Mujin.

12:29.415 --> 12:30.875
We'll do it while he's still rattled.

12:32.585 --> 12:34.003
Four people died.

12:35.629 --> 12:38.174
If the two gangs collide, more will die.

12:38.257 --> 12:39.341
Do not care?

12:41.927 --> 12:44.138
Because they're still all human beings.

12:45.931 --> 12:47.433
Those assholes can die.

12:51.854 --> 12:54.023
- [door opens]
- [Pildo] Let's get Choi Mujin first.

12:55.775 --> 12:56.817
[door closes]

12:57.485 --> 12:59.487
[tense music]

13:06.368 --> 13:07.453
[cell phone vibrates]

13:12.374 --> 13:15.795
MANGO IS BEING RELEASED.
IT'S A TRAP.

13:24.804 --> 13:27.056
[snickering]

13:43.864 --> 13:46.283
- The Musan branch is here.
- Get them ready.

13:51.247 --> 13:52.998
[Taeju] The other organizations are here.

13:53.082 --> 13:54.625
They are waiting your instructions.

13:58.712 --> 14:00.256
Send them all away.

14:02.299 --> 14:03.217
Sorry?

14:05.427 --> 14:06.804
Is there someone you trust?

14:08.848 --> 14:09.765
Yes.

14:11.183 --> 14:13.102
Cha Giho started a game,

14:15.521 --> 14:16.730
so I'll play too.

14:27.199 --> 14:29.285
[gamblers chatter]

14:36.041 --> 14:37.793
- [dealer] Bets down, please.
- [clicks]

14:40.629 --> 14:42.006
[Daesoo] And you saved
the best for yourself.

14:42.089 --> 14:43.841
- [Pildo] You can have it.
- [Daesoo] Gosh.

14:44.341 --> 14:45.551
- Hey.
- [Pildo] Hello, sir.

14:46.594 --> 14:47.511
Hey.

14:49.513 --> 14:51.348
Any word from the team on Dongcheon?

14:51.432 --> 14:52.850
[Gunpyeong] They're quiet.

14:52.933 --> 14:55.144
[Pildo] The peons are going around
gathering intel,

14:55.227 --> 14:56.979
but they haven't found Do Gangjae.

14:57.062 --> 14:59.565
Maybe they're getting help
from other organizations?

15:00.399 --> 15:02.234
No.
[inhales sharply]

15:02.318 --> 15:04.612
Choi Mujin will act personally.

15:08.657 --> 15:09.658
But…

15:13.662 --> 15:15.539
they may be crumbling from within.

15:15.623 --> 15:16.540
What?

15:18.250 --> 15:20.669
I think one of them will flip for us.

15:20.753 --> 15:21.795
[Daesoo] What…

15:21.879 --> 15:23.088
Who?

15:23.172 --> 15:24.548
[Cha Giho] I don't know yet.

15:25.174 --> 15:26.675
I'll meet him later.

15:26.759 --> 15:27.801
Pildo.

15:28.427 --> 15:30.179
- Yeah.
- Later.

15:30.262 --> 15:33.515
[Daesoo] What? When?
Where are you meeting him?

15:36.810 --> 15:39.229
[Ms. Kang] What should we do
about Yamamoto?

15:39.813 --> 15:41.607
Have him wait for the time being.

15:41.690 --> 15:44.068
For building a new factory
and get new chemists,

15:44.151 --> 15:45.402
it'll take too much time.

15:45.486 --> 15:47.863
The buyers are nervous, too.

15:47.947 --> 15:49.531
Taeju, you deal with the buyers.

15:50.199 --> 15:51.200
Yes, sir.

15:51.825 --> 15:54.119
You said there's
a new drug circulating, right?

15:55.454 --> 15:56.956
I think it's Gangjae.

15:58.791 --> 16:01.460
He wants me dead
so that he can take our market.

16:02.962 --> 16:03.963
So…

16:05.631 --> 16:08.592
if we get him, we get his drugs.

16:11.095 --> 16:12.888
[clicks tongue]
Yes, sir.

16:17.059 --> 16:18.477
[cell phone vibrates]

16:21.981 --> 16:24.233
A TRAITOR IS MEETING CHA GIHO.
I'LL LOOK INTO IT.

16:27.027 --> 16:28.278
[sighs]

16:39.206 --> 16:42.459
[engine revving]

16:43.168 --> 16:44.753
It's hard for us to keep waiting.

16:44.837 --> 16:46.255
That's all I'm saying.

16:46.839 --> 16:48.966
[buyer 1] And how long can we wait
without drugs?

16:49.675 --> 16:51.635
[buyer 2] Gangjae's gang is a problem too.

16:52.177 --> 16:53.846
But even Narcotics is after you.

16:53.929 --> 16:54.972
[exhales deeply]

16:55.055 --> 16:57.266
Well, whose side do you think
we should take then?

16:57.975 --> 16:59.685
What if a war breaks out?

17:01.020 --> 17:02.104
Well…

17:03.063 --> 17:04.940
you'll place your bet on who wins?

17:07.234 --> 17:08.110
[scoffs]

17:12.990 --> 17:13.907
All right.

17:13.991 --> 17:15.200
Go ahead.

17:15.951 --> 17:17.745
Just be sure to remember.

17:18.996 --> 17:22.082
The buy-in… is your life.

17:28.964 --> 17:30.049
[clears throat]

17:36.346 --> 17:38.432
- Keep watching them.
- Yes, sir.

18:09.880 --> 18:11.799
[distant horn honking]

18:20.933 --> 18:21.934
[camera shutter clicks]

18:24.561 --> 18:25.479
[camera shutter clicks]

18:27.815 --> 18:31.318
[suspenseful music]

18:56.093 --> 18:57.636
[camera shutter clicking]

19:29.042 --> 19:31.420
[engine revving]

19:37.009 --> 19:38.135
[alarm beeps]

19:47.936 --> 19:49.688
[tense music stings]

19:52.399 --> 19:54.193
You act like we've met before.

19:54.276 --> 19:55.402
Let me see your--

19:56.820 --> 19:57.863
[Pildo groans]

20:02.784 --> 20:04.453
[panting]

20:05.287 --> 20:06.205
[groans]

20:06.830 --> 20:09.416
[grunting]

20:15.255 --> 20:16.506
[grunts]

20:17.174 --> 20:18.800
[Pildo groaning]

20:21.094 --> 20:22.179
[groans]

20:25.474 --> 20:26.892
[thuds]

20:29.436 --> 20:30.854
[breathes heavily]

20:39.571 --> 20:40.447
[groans]

20:47.412 --> 20:48.705
[engine starts]

20:49.373 --> 20:51.583
[lighter clinking]

21:21.029 --> 21:24.700
[slow upbeat music]

21:25.492 --> 21:26.994
[engine revving]

21:37.713 --> 21:40.090
[slow upbeat music continues]

22:04.823 --> 22:05.824
[exhales deeply]

22:07.242 --> 22:08.201
[Cha Giho] So…

22:09.036 --> 22:11.705
Choi Mujin really did plant someone
among us.

22:13.332 --> 22:14.583
Pildo.

22:17.461 --> 22:19.338
Watch Oh Hyejin like a hawk.

22:20.339 --> 22:22.466
It feels like our intel has been leaking

22:23.050 --> 22:24.926
ever since she started with us.

22:25.469 --> 22:27.054
If she's their informant,

22:27.679 --> 22:30.098
and they removed the cameras
when she found them,

22:31.141 --> 22:33.101
why would they risk blowing her cover?

22:33.185 --> 22:35.020
What if they knew…

22:36.813 --> 22:38.440
exactly how we think?

22:40.108 --> 22:41.526
[chuckles]

22:42.569 --> 22:43.820
Let's go.

22:49.117 --> 22:50.118
Yes.

22:52.621 --> 22:53.830
[groans]

22:55.290 --> 22:56.708
It was a trap.

22:57.292 --> 22:59.294
[Mujin] Was Cha Giho trying to catch
my informant?

23:00.087 --> 23:01.254
Also…

23:03.173 --> 23:04.424
Jung Taeju was there.

23:17.979 --> 23:19.689
[Jiwoo] Don't do anything
for the time being.

23:20.273 --> 23:22.818
Cha Giho is waiting
for the organization to move.

23:25.404 --> 23:26.738
I'll find Gangjae.

23:33.829 --> 23:35.831
I've calmed down the buyers
for the time being.

23:36.373 --> 23:39.042
[pensive music]

23:45.340 --> 23:46.550
You may go.

23:50.554 --> 23:51.513
Yes, sir.

24:02.691 --> 24:03.608
[sighs]

24:05.110 --> 24:06.069
[clicks tongue]

24:06.903 --> 24:08.029
[sighs deeply]

24:08.655 --> 24:10.949
[paper rustling]

24:13.493 --> 24:14.536
[sighs]

24:15.036 --> 24:17.330
I'LL TELL YOU WHERE GANGJAE IS
DONGMYO PARK 11 P.M.

24:19.749 --> 24:21.543
[engine starts]

24:23.545 --> 24:25.338
[engine revs]

24:25.922 --> 24:27.424
- Pildo.
- [Pildo] Yeah.

24:29.885 --> 24:31.553
It's Detective Oh's file.

24:32.596 --> 24:33.597
Sir.

24:35.140 --> 24:36.641
Why did you call out Taeju?

24:36.725 --> 24:37.976
[inhales sharply]

24:38.685 --> 24:40.645
He planted a spy among us,

24:41.396 --> 24:43.023
so I threw a stone on his way.

24:44.524 --> 24:46.902
Let's see how far the ripples will travel.

24:48.195 --> 24:49.112
Work hard.

24:49.696 --> 24:50.864
Good night, sir.

24:51.948 --> 24:52.949
[door lock beeps]

25:02.000 --> 25:03.293
[Jiwoo grunts]

25:10.509 --> 25:11.468
[groans]

25:18.308 --> 25:21.436
PERSONNEL FILE

25:22.812 --> 25:25.065
PARENTS DECEASED
FATHER: OH JINYEONG

25:25.148 --> 25:30.654
THREW HIMSELF INTO ONCOMING TRAFFIC.
AUTOPSY REVEALS HE WAS USING METH.

25:33.240 --> 25:35.992
["My Name" playing]

25:38.078 --> 25:40.080
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

25:48.463 --> 25:51.675
[dramatic upbeat music playing]

25:56.221 --> 25:58.515
["My Name" continues playing]

26:29.004 --> 26:30.338
[Mujin] This is my knife.

26:31.047 --> 26:32.924
Kill him as soon as you find him.

26:39.014 --> 26:39.848
[drawer thuds]

26:49.899 --> 26:51.901
NATIONAL FORENSIC SERVICE

26:51.985 --> 26:55.238
[whirring]

26:57.240 --> 26:58.992
I'm Oh Hyejin from Narcotics.

26:59.743 --> 27:01.244
Is the ballistic report ready?

27:01.328 --> 27:03.705
Yes. I just left a message
for your captain.

27:06.833 --> 27:09.044
Did you determine whose gun it was?

27:09.127 --> 27:12.589
[staff] We don't have access to that here.
But we restored the gun's serial number.

27:19.804 --> 27:23.016
SERIAL NUMBER IS GL86575

27:23.099 --> 27:27.020
PHOTO 4. RESTORED SERIAL NUMBER

27:29.064 --> 27:29.939
[scoffs]

27:30.565 --> 27:31.650
[knock at door]

27:32.525 --> 27:35.654
[engine revving]

27:52.754 --> 27:55.131
ADMINISTRATION DEPARTMENT

27:56.216 --> 27:57.342
[door closes]

28:14.275 --> 28:17.570
- Choi Mujin left a gun at the crime scene.
- [commissioner] Why?

28:18.279 --> 28:19.948
[scoffs]
Why now?

28:20.031 --> 28:22.325
[Cha Giho] He's probably trying to bait me

28:22.992 --> 28:25.245
since he thought it was a cop's gun.

28:26.579 --> 28:27.455
[sighs]

28:28.790 --> 28:30.375
[exhales deeply]

28:31.876 --> 28:34.963
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY
GUN SERIAL NUMBER ANALYSIS REPORT

28:42.178 --> 28:43.221
[door lock beeps]

28:45.807 --> 28:47.100
Who is Song Joonsu?

28:54.607 --> 28:56.276
We got the firearm analysis back.

28:57.193 --> 28:58.903
I confirmed with the Administration.

29:03.491 --> 29:05.034
You pick it up?

29:06.202 --> 29:09.122
The gun was issued
to Corporal Song Joonsu in '04.

29:10.248 --> 29:12.208
Records show he was with Narcotics.

29:13.710 --> 29:14.711
[Jiwoo] Who is he?

29:14.794 --> 29:16.004
- [door lock beeps]
- [door opens]

29:22.093 --> 29:23.678
He was one of my guys.

29:25.013 --> 29:27.474
He died shortly after joining Narcotics.

29:29.851 --> 29:31.478
Was Dongcheon involved?

29:36.733 --> 29:38.151
Dongcheon killed him.

29:40.737 --> 29:42.071
[door closes]

29:47.702 --> 29:49.370
[Pildo] Is this the report?

29:49.454 --> 29:50.914
NAME: SONG JOONSU
SERIAL: GL86575

29:51.498 --> 29:53.374
So the gun was from Narcotics.

29:53.458 --> 29:55.710
DIED DURING OPERATION,
GUN WAS NOT RECOVERED

29:55.794 --> 29:59.005
SUPERVISOR IN CHARGE
NARCOTICS TEAM 1, LIEUTENANT CHA GIHO

30:05.261 --> 30:07.847
[engine revving]

30:22.987 --> 30:23.822
[car door closes]

30:30.119 --> 30:32.205
Did Dongcheon kill a cop in the past?

30:34.374 --> 30:36.876
[Jiwoo] The gun belonged to a cop
who died long ago.

30:37.502 --> 30:40.338
Cha Giho says that cop was murdered
while following Dongcheon…

30:40.421 --> 30:41.506
Didn't happen.

30:42.674 --> 30:44.425
[Mujin] We do not kill cops.

30:45.927 --> 30:48.179
Cha Giho has been chasing me for ages.

30:48.263 --> 30:50.348
He crossed the line years ago.

30:51.057 --> 30:53.393
[Mujin] He appeased, deceived,
and entrapped us.

30:53.476 --> 30:55.061
He did anything he could.

30:56.646 --> 30:58.523
And now that the gun has surfaced,

30:59.607 --> 31:01.442
he's starting to play dirty.

31:03.611 --> 31:04.779
Don't buy it.

31:14.122 --> 31:15.790
I'm telling the truth.

31:16.332 --> 31:18.334
The cops took all of it.

31:18.418 --> 31:19.627
[sobs]

31:23.798 --> 31:24.757
[poker chip clinks]

31:24.841 --> 31:25.925
You know…

31:26.009 --> 31:27.176
[Mango] Huh?

31:27.260 --> 31:28.386
…there aren't…

31:28.469 --> 31:31.139
- [Mango groans]
- …very many people…

31:31.681 --> 31:35.310
- [groans]
- …in this world that I like.

31:36.144 --> 31:37.353
Especially…

31:39.606 --> 31:42.567
can't stand assholes that lie.

31:44.444 --> 31:47.488
- But who in this line of work doesn't lie?
- [mutters]

31:47.572 --> 31:49.741
It's a world of villains.

31:53.369 --> 31:55.955
Listen, if you're gonna lie to me…

31:56.039 --> 31:57.123
Here.

31:57.206 --> 31:59.167
- Put more thought into it.
- That's not it, Gangjae…

31:59.250 --> 32:00.168
[groans]

32:00.251 --> 32:04.255
[screaming in pain]

32:04.339 --> 32:06.674
You need to show sincerity.

32:06.758 --> 32:08.635
[screaming]

32:10.219 --> 32:11.512
[coughs]

32:13.723 --> 32:14.891
SONG JOONSU DEATH REPORT

32:14.974 --> 32:17.018
HE WAS A CIVIL SERVANT.
WHILE TRACKING THE ROUTE OF

32:17.101 --> 32:20.063
DONGCHEON'S NEW DRUG,
HE FOUND AN IMPORTANT CLUE

32:20.146 --> 32:22.148
TO CHOI MUJIN.
AND DURING INVESTIGATION…

32:23.024 --> 32:24.192
[Daesoo] What does it say?

32:24.943 --> 32:26.027
- Hey.
- [Daesoo] Hmm.

32:26.110 --> 32:27.779
Gangjae's and Mango's are the same.

32:27.862 --> 32:29.405
- LSD?
- Yeah.

32:29.489 --> 32:30.740
Oh, jeez.

32:30.823 --> 32:32.283
Hold on.

32:32.367 --> 32:33.493
[knock at door]

32:34.953 --> 32:36.079
[Daesoo] Captain.

32:36.746 --> 32:37.914
On my desk.

32:40.792 --> 32:41.960
[Pildo] Detective Oh.

32:43.294 --> 32:44.629
What are you doing later?

32:47.048 --> 32:48.174
Why?

32:49.050 --> 32:50.468
Wanna grab soju?

32:54.097 --> 32:55.473
I have plans.

32:56.557 --> 32:58.601
Okay. See you.

33:02.730 --> 33:04.565
- [door lock beeps]
- [door opens]

33:07.527 --> 33:09.654
"Wanna grab some soju with me?"

33:09.737 --> 33:12.198
- Rejected!
- [groans]

33:12.281 --> 33:14.701
- She's not easy.
- She's not. God, loser.

33:14.784 --> 33:16.869
- Wait! Buy me a soju!
- [door lock beeps]

33:17.453 --> 33:18.538
Gunpyeong.

33:18.621 --> 33:21.249
"Wanna get some liquor?"
[giggling]

33:22.959 --> 33:25.461
[slow upbeat music]

33:35.179 --> 33:38.141
[indistinct chatter]

33:40.727 --> 33:43.021
Have you heard of Do Gangjae or this drug?

33:48.609 --> 33:50.695
[Pildo whistles]

34:13.551 --> 34:15.678
[upbeat music]

34:22.560 --> 34:24.062
[inaudible]

34:38.576 --> 34:40.411
[tires screech]

34:46.501 --> 34:48.753
[alarm blaring]

34:54.050 --> 34:55.259
[car door opens]

34:57.303 --> 34:58.596
[sighs]

34:59.889 --> 35:01.099
What are you doing here?

35:02.558 --> 35:04.560
Pildo, what are you doing here?

35:04.644 --> 35:05.645
Answer me.

35:06.646 --> 35:07.688
[Pildo sighs]

35:09.690 --> 35:11.859
- I was watching Mango.
- Why?

35:11.943 --> 35:14.028
The drugs left in the gym
was the same ones

35:14.112 --> 35:15.404
that Mango was carrying with him.

35:15.488 --> 35:16.572
[Pildo] I know that.

35:18.741 --> 35:21.035
I'm asking why you're investigating alone.

35:22.912 --> 35:24.831
Because dangerous assholes have a new drug

35:24.914 --> 35:26.624
and no one is investigating.

35:29.669 --> 35:30.795
Is that all?

35:33.589 --> 35:35.675
- [approaching footsteps]
- [door slams]

35:37.009 --> 35:39.345
[footsteps thudding]

35:39.428 --> 35:40.930
[car door opens]

35:42.014 --> 35:43.015
[car door closes]

35:44.308 --> 35:46.269
- [engine starts]
- [car door closes]

35:46.352 --> 35:49.313
[engine revving]

35:50.231 --> 35:51.732
I'm going to find Gangjae.

35:53.651 --> 35:56.279
Act on your own again,
and I'll make you regret it.

35:56.863 --> 35:57.989
[Pildo] Drive.

36:04.203 --> 36:06.414
[engine revving]

36:09.542 --> 36:12.503
[upbeat music]

36:15.965 --> 36:17.175
[man 1] Have a good night.

36:17.258 --> 36:19.260
- [man 2] Thank you.
- [old lady] Come again.

36:24.932 --> 36:26.309
[old lady] Welcome back.

36:35.568 --> 36:37.862
- You're coming often lately.
- Yes.

36:37.945 --> 36:39.989
- [old lady] Spicy fish stew and soju?
- Yes, please.

36:40.072 --> 36:40.990
Okay.

36:51.876 --> 36:52.877
[Gunpyeong] Yes?

36:54.462 --> 36:56.380
[keyboard clacking]

36:56.464 --> 36:57.423
It's 261.

36:58.049 --> 36:59.133
Beomya-ro.

36:59.967 --> 37:01.135
[mouse clicks]

37:11.395 --> 37:12.563
Okay. Thanks.

37:16.234 --> 37:18.236
It's a factory that shut down last month.

37:32.250 --> 37:33.918
[engine revs]

38:09.620 --> 38:10.788
[sighs]

38:12.540 --> 38:14.333
Tailing a druggie on a Friday?

38:15.167 --> 38:17.295
Why are you working so hard on this?

38:17.878 --> 38:19.588
You got no friends?

38:19.672 --> 38:21.924
Well, I don't see you
surrounded by friends.

38:23.384 --> 38:24.510
[scoffs]

38:28.681 --> 38:30.141
You're doing this…

38:31.058 --> 38:32.310
because of your dad, right?

38:38.899 --> 38:39.900
[old lady] Welcome.

38:39.984 --> 38:41.902
[chuckles]

38:41.986 --> 38:43.696
Uh, I forgot my cigarettes.

38:44.280 --> 38:45.156
Hm.

38:45.656 --> 38:47.658
Would you go and buy me a pack, please?

38:51.829 --> 38:52.872
Please, ma'am.

38:57.501 --> 38:59.879
[door slides close]

39:02.298 --> 39:04.717
- [liquid pouring]
- [bottle clanks]

39:11.599 --> 39:14.643
[Pildo] Your dad was an addict, wasn't he?

39:16.562 --> 39:18.522
He was high when he was in that accident.

39:20.733 --> 39:22.443
You're looking for someone, right?

39:23.903 --> 39:25.154
Who is it?

39:27.365 --> 39:29.492
[distant horn honking]

39:57.228 --> 39:59.980
[suspenseful music]

40:16.831 --> 40:17.998
[car door closes]

40:18.082 --> 40:19.542
He gave it to him for free?

40:24.672 --> 40:26.507
I don't see any of his minions.

40:35.891 --> 40:37.101
[screams]

40:38.018 --> 40:39.353
[grunts]

40:39.437 --> 40:40.646
[screams]

40:48.028 --> 40:50.322
[upbeat music]

40:50.406 --> 40:52.408
[music fades]

40:54.869 --> 40:56.871
[upbeat music]

40:58.456 --> 41:00.374
[approaching footsteps]

41:00.958 --> 41:02.209
- [metal clanks]
- [shouting]

41:03.961 --> 41:06.380
- [all grunting]
- [metal clanking]

41:11.719 --> 41:13.929
[all grunting]

41:18.100 --> 41:20.102
[grunting]

41:22.563 --> 41:24.565
[struggled groaning]

41:27.985 --> 41:29.487
- [grunts]
- Argh!

41:32.990 --> 41:34.033
[clanks]

41:35.618 --> 41:37.536
[both panting]

41:42.708 --> 41:45.252
[all grunting]

41:45.336 --> 41:46.795
- [tires screech]
- [crashes]

41:51.967 --> 41:53.469
[men yelling]

41:54.970 --> 41:56.847
[grunting]

41:57.973 --> 41:59.558
[man 1 groans]

42:00.601 --> 42:02.353
[man 2 grunting]

42:04.396 --> 42:05.648
- [yells]
- [groans]

42:07.650 --> 42:09.318
[grunting]

42:11.070 --> 42:12.238
[man 3 shouts]

42:13.155 --> 42:15.032
- [Pildo grunts]
- [loud thud]

42:16.784 --> 42:17.868
[coughs]

42:17.952 --> 42:19.328
[gasps]

42:19.411 --> 42:20.329
[grunts]

42:22.581 --> 42:23.791
[man 4 screams]

42:26.377 --> 42:27.920
- [knife clanks]
- [man grunts]

42:28.921 --> 42:30.589
[groans]

42:36.554 --> 42:37.888
Where's Do Gangjae?

42:40.558 --> 42:42.184
Where's Do Gangjae?

42:47.731 --> 42:49.858
[Jiwoo groaning]

42:51.986 --> 42:53.821
[breathing heavily]

42:55.197 --> 42:57.741
[Gangjae laughing]

42:58.701 --> 43:01.161
[laughing continues]

43:02.162 --> 43:03.998
[Gangjae] A fortune-teller told me…

43:04.498 --> 43:10.337
this would be a lucky year for me.
[giggling]

43:10.421 --> 43:12.006
[Mango] This is from our security camera.

43:12.089 --> 43:13.716
She suddenly showed up,

43:13.799 --> 43:16.510
beat up all my guys,
and took all the drugs.

43:16.594 --> 43:18.887
[Mango breathes heavily]
That fucking narc.

43:18.971 --> 43:20.598
[Cheolho] Stop whining about some narc.

43:20.681 --> 43:21.974
Shut the fuck up.

43:22.057 --> 43:26.520
- [laughing]
- [Cheolho] What? What? Show me.

43:27.229 --> 43:28.731
- Hey!
- [hysterical laugh]

43:28.814 --> 43:30.649
It's the fucking bitch!

43:30.733 --> 43:32.526
[Gangjae laughs hysterically]

43:32.610 --> 43:35.696
[Gangjae laughing]

43:36.780 --> 43:37.781
[Gangjae] Bang.

43:39.700 --> 43:42.953
[laughter]

43:46.081 --> 43:47.499
Oh Hyejin.

43:52.171 --> 43:55.007
Oh Hyejin the detective.

43:58.677 --> 43:59.845
[Gangjae sucks teeth]

44:02.556 --> 44:04.141
Lovely to see you,

44:05.517 --> 44:07.394
you fucking bitch.

44:12.608 --> 44:14.610
[closing theme music]
